# Build context excludes
# Repo root is the context; skip upstream submodule git data and the huge pack outputs.

**/.git
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache

# Repomix packs and scratch research output are not build inputs
.claude/
research/
repomix-output.xml

# Container/state data
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
